ype":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested in 4.4.1 Stable for Mac on an M4 Mac.\n\n### System information\n\nMac Metal 4.4.1 Stabel\n\n### Issue description\n\nOn the Mac version of Godot 4.4.1 stable label.text.capitalize() is returning the original string instead of the capitalized string.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a scene with a margin container as a parent and a label as the child.\nGive the label some text in mixed or lower case.\nAttach a script to the container that looks something like:\n\n```\nextends MarginContainer\n\n@onready var label: Label = $Label\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tprint (label.text.capitalize())\n```\n\n\n```\n\n[labelcapstest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21922789/labelcapstest.zip)\n\n```\n\nIt prints the original text instead of the capitalized text.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[labelcapstest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21922798/labelcapstest.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandS